# The tone, the quality of a vibe's experience, the first base element. It is the ternary value with three cases: a low value, a middle value, and a high value. Three is forced. The smallest usable alphabet needs a resting middle value and a mirror that swaps the two sides, and the three-case set is the smallest with both.
form tone
  case low
  case middle
  case high

# The tone is ternary, proof-checked by `seed test`: three cases, a resting middle and a mirrored pair around it. Three
# is the smallest alphabet with both a middle and a mirror: 3 = 1 + 2.
hold tone-has-three-cases
  call is-equal
    code 3
    call add
      code 1
      code 2
